{
    "name": "dpanel",
    "display_name": "DPanel",
    "description": "DPanel 是国产开源的轻量化 Docker 可视化管理面板，中文界面友好，支持容器、镜像、Compose、文件管理及 SSH 终端等功能。",
    "category": "docker",
    "tags": [
        "docker",
        "容器管理",
        "可视化面板",
        "中文",
        "开源"
    ],
    "website": "https://dpanel.cc/",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/donknap/dpanel",
    "architectures": [
        "amd64",
        "arm64"
    ],
    "image": "dpanel/dpanel",
    "default_ports": [
        {
            "port": 8807,
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "description": "Web 管理面板（容器内 8080）"
        }
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
            "ports",
            "volumes",
            "dpanel_env"
        ],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "dpanel",
                "title": "DPanel",
                "settings": [
                    {
                        "type": "ports",
                        "title": "端口设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "ports"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "volumes",
                        "title": "存储空间设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "volumes"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "env",
                        "title": "环境变量",
                        "fields": [
                            "dpanel_env"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "advanced",
                        "title": "高级设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "privileged"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "description": "DPanel 轻量化 Docker 可视化管理面板"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "local_port",
                        "container_port",
                        "protocol"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {
                            "enum": [
                                "tcp",
                                "udp"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "协议",
                            "default": "tcp"
                        },
                        "local_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "本地端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        },
                        "container_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "容器端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "protocol": "tcp",
                        "local_port": 8807,
                        "container_port": 8080
                    }
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "host_path",
                        "container_path",
                        "mode"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {
                            "enum": [
                                "rw",
                                "ro"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "权限",
                            "default": "rw"
                        },
                        "host_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "本地路径",
                            "format": "directory"
                        },
                        "container_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "容器路径"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "/var/run/docker.sock",
                        "container_path": "/var/run/docker.sock"
                    },
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "dpanel/data",
                        "container_path": "/dpanel"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            },
            "dpanel_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "key",
                        "value"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "变量名"
                        },
                        "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "值"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "key": "TZ",
                        "value": "Asia/Shanghai"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "APP_NAME",
                        "value": "dpanel"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  dpanel:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in dpanel_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
    "readme": "# DPanel\n\nDPanel 是国产开源的轻量化 Docker 可视化管理面板，中文界面友好，提供容器、镜像、存储、网络、Compose、文件管理与 SSH 终端等功能。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 「存储空间设置」中已默认挂载 `/var/run/docker.sock`（必需）和数据目录 `/dpanel`。\n2. 面板容器内监听 `8080` 端口，默认映射到宿主机 `8807`，可在「端口设置」中修改对外端口。\n3. 环境变量 `APP_NAME` 需与面板实例名保持一致，默认为 `dpanel`。\n\n## 使用\n\n1. 部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:8807/dpanel/ui`。\n2. 首次进入需设置管理员用户名和密码。\n\n## 说明\n\n- 标准版镜像还提供域名绑定与 HTTPS 证书功能（需额外映射 80/443 端口）；如不需要可改用 `dpanel/dpanel:lite` 镜像。\n- 面板通过 docker.sock 管理 Docker，请勿将面板端口暴露到公网。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [
        "/dpanel"
    ],
    "is_builtin": false
}
